ease\n```\nOptimize for performance (enables `-O3`-style optimizations). This is the standard production build type.\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr -DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib\n```\n- Install files to `/usr`\n- Put libraries in `/usr/lib` (important on multilib systems to avoid `/usr/lib64` confusion)\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_C_COMPILER="}